{"name":"3D TTT","dev":"Franz Enzenhofer","keys":["ios:6763501981"],"ios":{"id":"6763501981","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/3d-ttt/id6763501981?uo=4","rating":0,"ratings":0,"price":"Free","genre":"Games","screens":["https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/bd/c1/dc/bdc1dc2d-df07-4761-1b9a-e5559337094d/01_neon.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/90/88/b8/9088b8d2-4ec9-1b90-1658-22603e7d105d/02_sunny.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/a5/13/b1/a513b14f-146c-e690-25e9-0c1229205f5b/03_holiday.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/f3/ed/7f/f3ed7f16-9f47-df38-6693-14f16323f983/04_mono.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/ce/58/8c/ce588c19-8385-142c-aa3e-f68949961a8c/05_synthwave.png/320x480bb.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/5c/03/1c/5c031ce6-8fa3-929c-d4ed-d3b72a961565/06_sakura.png/320x480bb.jpg"],"desc":"Tic-tac-toe, in a 3x3x3 cube. Most strikes wins. Harder than you think.\n\nSpin the cube. Stack three in any direction - rows, columns, verticals, four long diagonals through the centre. 27 cells. 49 winning lines. The classic, in a third dimension.\n\nBEAT THE AI\nSuper Hard runs a perfect iterative-deepening solver. Most can't take it. Try Normal first.\n\nTHREE MODES\n- Player vs CPU. Solo grind.\n- Player vs Player. Pass and play on one device.\n- CPU vs CPU. Watch the solver duel itself.\n\nCUSTOMISE\n- 18 themes: Neon, Sakura, Synthwave, Ocean and more.\n- Optional per-turn shot clock for pressure.\n- Pick who moves first - you, CPU, or random.\n\nPRIVACY FIRST\nFully offline. No ads. No tracking. No accounts. No network calls. Free. Forever.\n\niPhone and iPad. Swipe to spin. Pinch to zoom. Tap to place.","released":"2026-04-27","updated":"2026-07-26","icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/d0/1d/b0/d01db054-1525-a03e-d3ed-d47f850b3ba5/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","age":"4+"},"android":null,"icon":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/d0/1d/b0/d01db054-1525-a03e-d3ed-d47f850b3ba5/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-8-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","cat":"Games","rating":null,"ratings":0,"mentions":1,"users":1,"threads":1,"hn_points":1,"hn_comments":1,"submissions":1,"self_n":1,"hn_score":2.0,"first":1777578338,"last":1777578338,"show_hn":null,"n_lab":0,"pos_pct":null,"neg_pct":null,"mood":null,"quotes":[{"id":47967327,"k":"ios:6763501981","type":"story","by":"franze","time":1777578338,"text":"","title":"3D Tic Tac Toe","story_id":47967327,"story_title":"3D Tic Tac Toe","story_score":1,"comments":1,"w":2.0,"u":-1,"s":"pos","self":true}],"slug":"3d-ttt"}